.com" required autocomplete="off"><p class="fine-print">Choose a unique email-format ID. An existing mailbox is not required.</p><button>Create staff account</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Staff sign-in</h2><ol><li>Save the temporary password shown after creation and give it privately to the staff member.</li><li>Staff replace it with their own password on first sign-in.</li><li>Staff set up their authenticator before using staff features.</li></ol><p>Assign staff to a creator below to grant event access. If a password is lost, issue a new temporary password from Accounts &amp; societies. Existing MFA stays enabled.</p></section></div><h2>Review queue</h2><?php if(!$pending):?><p class="notice">All caught up. No events are waiting for approval.</p><?php endif;?><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Creator</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($pending as $event):?><tr><td><a href="event.php?id=<?=(int)$event['event_id']?>"><strong><?=e($event['title'])?></strong> ↗</a><br><span class="muted"><?=e($event['start_time'])?> · <?=e($event['location'])?></span></td><td><?=e($event['organiser_name'])?></td><td><div class="actions"><?php foreach(['approve'=>'Approve','reject'=>'Reject']as $action=>$label):?><form method="post" action="admin_action.php"><?=csrfField()?><input type="hidden" name="event_id" value="<?=(int)$event['event_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="<?=$action?>"><button class="<?=$action==='reject'?'danger':''?>"><?=$label?></button></form><?php endforeach;?></div></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div>
